---
title: "SSD: Request Time Off (UC-02) and Decide It (UC-10)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant System as :System
    actor Manager
    Employee->>System: requestTimeOff(startDate, endDate, reason)
    alt dates in the past, backwards, or already asked for
        System-->>Employee: error, nothing saved
    else
        System-->>Employee: saved as pending
    end
    Manager->>System: decideTimeOff(requestId, decision)
    System-->>Manager: approved or denied, schedule checked again
    Note over System,Manager: once approved, R2 blocks any shift<br/>the employee has on those days
